bat
------------------------------------------
A cat(1) clone with syntax highlighting and Git integration.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cargo-1.91.0-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sharkdp/bat

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sharkdp/bat/archive/refs/tags/v0.26.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack bat-0.26.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./bat-0.26.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/bat-0.26.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/bat-0.26.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(bat)
  /usr/bin/bat.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/bat.README
  /usr/share/doc/bat/NOTICE
  /usr/share/doc/bat/README.md

------------------

